  description: One is a whisper. The swarm is a sentence. Each brass belly glows
    green with a single tiny opinion about you.
  tactics: 1 HP, swarms, and every one spits a brief homing nip. Individually harmless
    - collectively they fill every lane you planned to use. Sweep them casually with
    spread fire and never let them accumulate behind you.
